Top-right ✕ per dismiss canon; Esc and scrim-click also dismiss, never as the only exit. Sign out is NOT here — it lives in Settings (Account group, danger row with the signed-in email, RULED 08-03). The Grow surface's UI label is **Posts** (RULED 08-05); a pending review item marks the row `unread=true`, rendering the right-side blue dot (accent left border BANNED).
